    "detailed_description": "<h1>\ud83c\udfb4 CHECK THE FULL GAME</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The full game is now out on Steam!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>This Prologue is a free version of the<strong> turn-based combat game with rogue-like and deck-building elements</strong> Shogun Showdown.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2316330/extras/5a17a68b58d70c6d0ef72dc9749b0aae.poster.avif?t=1729323996\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2316330/extras/5a17a68b58d70c6d0ef72dc9749b0aae.webm?t=1729323996\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2316330/extras/5a17a68b58d70c6d0ef72dc9749b0aae.mp4?t=1729323996\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PROLOGUE FEATURES</h2><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Play The Wanderer: a lone warrior haunted by her past who travels the land seeking redemption through battle<br></li><li>3 combat locations: The Bamboo Grove, The Waterfall Caves and The Port City.<br></li><li>14 attack tiles<br></li><li>8 quests and 2 challenges<br></li><li>10+ skills</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2316330/extras/4d0fb1ce18e718a7708ca7fa1d21f4ac.poster.avif?t=1729323996\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2316330/extras/4d0fb1ce18e718a7708ca7fa1d21f4ac.webm?t=1729323996\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2316330/extras/4d0fb1ce18e718a7708ca7fa1d21f4ac.mp4?t=1729323996\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
